{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：06:12 2026-11-15 HKT<br/>發佈時間：06:12 2026-11-15 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：06:12 2026-11-15 HKT</p><img alt=\"中環男子遇襲臉部遭鎅傷 清醒送院治理。黎志偉攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/79cfcdb2cab01c8f960b0d05d6dd04e9/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_25_51.jpeg\"/><p>中環凌晨發生傷人事件。今日（15日）凌晨3時許，警方接獲一名男子報案，指其年約20歲的男性友人在皇后大道中29號遇襲受傷。救援人員趕至現場，發現男子臉部有鎅傷傷口，經治理後被送往瑪麗醫院治理，警方正調查事件。</p><img alt=\"警員接報到場調查事件。黎志偉攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ab5396f4e8635a6d7ae67d4e030bbd5d/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_25_51_1_.jpeg\" title=\"警員接報到場調查事件。黎志偉攝\"/><p>警員接報到場調查事件。黎志偉攝</p>\n<p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T22:31:54.152986+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":203,"images":2,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T22:12:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T23:05:38.666336+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T22:25:06.926550+00:00","content_hash":"9773fad4f349baea13d6280daf93af8bcf7cf5e713a4964df9197b5a31a94e01","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}